{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422460/extras/\uc601\uc5b4_\ud5e4\ub354_01.png?t=1747377311\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Welcome to the \u201cPaw-City\u201d where a variety of animals live together!</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As an employee of the \u201cRailroad Corp.\u201d, you are in charge of \u2028designing railroads and connecting animal towns. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Connect the Paw-City with your creative strategies and designs!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422460/extras/\uc601\uc5b4_\ud5e4\ub354_02.png?t=1747377311\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Design a railroad to connect animal towns!</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The train starts running along the railroad you designed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you have a new animal town, don't panic, just delete the railroad and redesign it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make animal residents comfortable on the train!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422460/extras/steam_desc_01.gif?t=1747377311\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422460/extras/\uc601\uc5b4_\ud5e4\ub354_03.png?t=1747377311\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Items are a great help in railroad design!</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At set times, we'll give you items to help you play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use them to strategize your railroad!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422460/extras/steam_desc_02.gif?t=1747377311\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422460/extras/\uc601\uc5b4_\ud5e4\ub354_04.png?t=1747377311\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Don't panic if your railroad suddenly breaks!</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As your Paw-City grows, disasters can suddenly strike and ruin your routes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use a variety of items and your brilliant strategy to respond efficiently!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Keep designing efficient railroads for them \u2028and grow your Paw City!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422460/extras/steam_desc_03.gif?t=1747377311\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3422460?t=1747377311","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3422460?t=1747377311","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422460/232cbffce6ac74447440f207069fdc6a81520b4e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747377311","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422460/232cbffce6ac74447440f207069fdc6a81520b4e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747377311","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3427290,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422460/extras/\uc601\uc5b4_\ud5e4\ub354_01.png?t=1747377311\" /></p><h2 class=\